Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  data.tar.gz -> input/USA-road-d.BAY.gr.parboil, input/NYR_input.dat,
  output/BAY_bfs.out, output/NYR_bfs.out

What:
  Road networks of the San Francisco Bay area and New York City, with
  reference outputs.

Source:
  Chai benchmark suite, https://github.com/chai-benchmarks/chai,
  CUDA-D-Sim/BFS/input and CUDA-D-Sim/SSSP/output (byte-identical at
  commit 61db988, checked 2026-11-19). The networks are from the 9th
  DIMACS Implementation Challenge, derived from US Census TIGER/Line
